# Sound drivers, taken whole from Arch's kernel config (7.2.7-arch1), merged by
# `build.zsh kernel` after kernel.syn. Laptop audio is a long tail (SOF
# DSPs, SoundWire codecs, HDA side-codec amps behind I2C/SPI), and a
# distribution config is the practical way to cover it. Symbols newer
# than this kernel are dropped by olddefconfig. Regenerate by filtering
# CONFIG_SND*, CONFIG_SOUNDWIRE* and the amp helpers below out of a newer
# Arch config.
